   579	/**
   580	 * The Academy as R2App draws it (C42): the title row with the learner's
   581	 * pills, the 1.4fr/1fr frame (Academy's own learner pages on the left,
   582	 * the learner's place on the right) and the Learning paths row, around
   583	 * the hosted learner pages with the Rust-owned theme. Signed out, the
   584	 * guest generation reads the public catalog; signed in, the account
   585	 * generation. Learner effects mount only here. The embed's content is
   586	 * Academy's own (P19); nothing here signs in or sends on its own.
